**`Owner`** (→ `OwnerDto`, lines 2040+) — `allOf` [ `OwnerFields` + `{ id: integer, ... }` ], i.e. all OwnerFields plus a read-only `id` (and pets).

Since the DTOs carry only the OpenAPI-declared getters/setters (`getFirstName`/`setFirstName`, …, `getTelephone`/`setTelephone`, plus `getId` on `OwnerDto`), any new request field (e.g. a structured address / postcode seen referenced in the tests) would need to be added to the `OwnerFields` schema in `openapi.yml` to appear on `OwnerFieldsDto`.

